    <string name="prayer_hail_holy_queen">Siyakubingelela, Nkosikazi, Nina wesihe,\nimpilo yethu, ubumnandi bethu nethemba lethu, siyakubingelela!\nKuwe sikhala, bantwana baka-Eva abaxoshiwe;\nKuwe sibubula, sikhalela futhi sikhala kulesi sigodi sezinyembezi.\nKunjalo-ke, mncengeli wethu,\nphendulela amehlo akho anesihe kithi\nbese emva kokuxoshwa kwethu, sibonise uJesu,\nisithelo esibusisiwe sesizalo sakho.\nO onomusa, o onothando, o Nkosazana uMariya omnandi.\n\nSikhulumele, Nina ongcwele kaNkulunkulu,\nukuze senziwe sifanele izithembiso zikaKristu.\nAmen.</string>
